<title>SPAIN: Spanish 1-, 5-yr yields fall, rise in 15-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Spanish 1-, 5-yr yields fall, rise in 15-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>    ISSUE   Yield   Pvs    Price    Pvs    Bid     Allocated     1-year  5.579   5.800  94.660   94.46  967.72  292.07 </p>
<p>    5-year  6.132   6.304  106.65   105.35 446.82  205.92 </p>
<p>    15-year 7.184   7.149  112.70   112.40 58.05   18.35  </p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
